# Project 2

## Code Structure

The code for this project is organized into the following files:

### `odometry.py`

### `icp.py`

### `scan_matching.py`

### `occupancy_grid_mapping.py`

### `texture_mapping.py`

### `factor_graph.py`

## Running the Code

Note that each of these functions can be ran individually and will run the code related to its subpart in the project. For instance, 
`odometry.py` will run the Encoder and IMU odometry section while `icp.py` will run the ICP warm up section. The organization above shows the order it was revealed in the project document. 

python __.py

will run each individual section. If the dataset number wants to be changed, there is a variable for each code that can be changed for this purpose. 


## Results

All results can be found in the results folder.